  "verseCount": 28,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "45",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "GEN 45"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "45",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yusufu okwemanyekania ase abamwabo; barabwo bakairana inka sobo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 45:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agwo Yusufu agasinywa gotanga okweigwa kwaye, ase obosio bw’abaanto bonsi abateneine ang’e nere, agaaka eriogi, akabora, “Barusie aa bonsi ase obosio bwane!” Ase igo, monto onde tareengeo ase obosio bwa Yusufu ekero emanyekanetie ase abamwabo,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.45.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.45.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 45:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "korende ekero aagete eriogi ase okorera, Abamisiri amo nabaanto b’enka ya Farao bakamoigwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.45.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.45.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 45:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yusufu agateebia bamura bamwabo: “Ninche Yusufu. Tata moyo are?” Korende bamura bamwabo tibanyara komoiraneria, ekiagera basoetwe nobwoba obonene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.45.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.45.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 45:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Yusufu agateebia bamura bamwabo: “Inchuo ase ’nde ang’e!” Barabwo bakamoika ang’e. Naende akabateebia: “Ninche Yusufu omiino, oyo mwaoonetie gocha aa Misiri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.45.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.45.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 45:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende timoichana, gose timwechanda ase emioyo yaino, ekiagera mwang’oonetie gocha aa. Naki Nyasae nere ontomete mbatang’anere gocha aa, erinde ntoorie obogima bw’abaanto.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.45.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.45.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 45:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omwaka oyo noyo o kabere enchara ere ase ense, naende netigarete emiaka etano abanto batareme gose kogesa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.45.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.45.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 45:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyasae nigo antomete mbatang’anere inwe, erinde motigare ase ense, na koba moyo ase ogotooreka kw’abange.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.45.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.45.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 45:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase igo,, tari inwe mwantomete gocha aa, korende Nyasae omonyene. Nere ombegete imbe ise Farao, n’Omonene ase enka yaye yonsi, na omogambi ase ense yonsi ya Misiri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.45.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.45.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 45:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ayerera bwango, moirane gochia ase tata, momoteebie iga: Aya naro omwana oo Yusufu agoteeba: Nyasae ombekire koba Omonene ase ense yonsi ya Misiri; tirimboka gocha ase ’nde, totebana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.45.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.45.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 45:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye nigo oramenye ase ensemo ya Goseni, nigo oramenye ang’e nainche, aye amo nabana bao, na abachokoro bao.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.45.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.45.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 45:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agwo inche ninkoragerie, erinde tobaisa gocha gosoa ase okoremeerwa, aye amo nabaanto bao, na bionsi ebi ore nabio, ekiagera emiaka etano y’enchara netigarete.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.45.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.45.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 45:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Na bono imorooche namaiso aino, na Benjamini boigo narooche namaiso aye, ng’a ninche omonyene ngokwana nainwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.45.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.45.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 45:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moteebie tata obonene bwonsi mbwate aiga Misiri, na binde bionsi mwarorire. Mokore bwango, momorente gocha aa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.45.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.45.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 45:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio akaboania Benjamini rigoti, akarera; Benjamini nere akarera kamoboanetie rigoti riaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.45.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.45.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 45:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yusufu akanyunyunta abamwabo bonsi, akarera ase bare. Na magega y’ayio abamwabo bakagosoria nere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.45.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.45.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 45:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero chinkuma chiaigwekanete ase enka ya Farao ng’a abamwabo Yusufu bachire, amang’ana ayio akagwenera Farao amo nabasomba baye bonsi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.45.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.45.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 45:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Farao agateebia Yusufu: “Bateebie abamino iga: Berekia ching’iti chiaino chigurube, moimoke mogende ase ense yaino ya Kaanani,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.45.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.45.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 45:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Morente iso na abanto b’enka yaye bache ase ’nde. Inche nimbae ebire ebiya bi’ense ya Misiri, na inwe namorie obonoru bw’ense eye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.45.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.45.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 45:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naende goika obateebie iga, Ira chigari korwa aa Misiri, ase okobogoreria abana baino abake, na abakungu baino, mobogorerie na iso, moche nabarabwo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.45.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.45.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 45:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Timochandekera ebinto biaino, ebi moratige magega, ekiagera bionsi ebire ebiya mono ase ense ya Misiri nebiaino.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.45.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.45.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 45:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio basinto ba Israeli bagakora buna bateebetigwe, na Yusufu akabaa chigari buna Farao achiigete, amo nendagera bagochia koria inchera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.45.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.45.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 45:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akaa kera oyomo eanga agochia koonchoreria, korende Benjamini ere akamoa chisekeli chi’echifeta amagana atato amo ne chianga isano, echi agochia koonchoreria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.45.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.45.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 45:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agatomera na ise chitigere ikomi chiabogoretie ebinto ebiya mono bia Misiri, ne chitigere chiaberi chiabogoretie endagera, na emegati, na endagera ende agochia koria inchera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.45.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.45.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 45:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio agatigana nabamwabo bagende sobo, akabateebia: “Timobaisa kwomana inchera!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.45.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.45.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 45:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Barabwo bakarua Misiri, bagaika ense ya Kaanani ase Yakobo ise.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.45.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.45.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 45:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agwo bakamanyia ise amang’ana ng’a Yusufu moyo are, naende nere omogambi ase ense yonsi ya Misiri. Yakobo agachia koyaigwa, akagoyaana ase omoyo oye, tanyara kwegena amang’ana abo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.45.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.45.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 45:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende bakamoteebia amang’ana onsi Yusufu abateebetie. Ere agachia korora chigari chiria Yusufu amotomerete chigocha komoimokia, omoyo oye okaba nobogima oboyia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.45.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.45.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 45:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Israeli akabora: “Ayio aisanire. Yusufu, omwana one, moyo are. Nigo ndagende komoorora ritang’ani ntarakwa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.45.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.45.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
